invariant: INV-7
file: quic.c
catches: quic_driver_test
reason: ch_quic_init leaves the negotiated version at 0 instead of the
  original version, so every Handshake and 1-RTT packet in the version
  the client sent is refused and ch_quic_negotiated_version reports a
  version no packet carries. test/quic_version_tests.h requires the
  original version after init.

--- old
    q->t.quic_negotiated_version = cfg->quic_original_version;
#ifdef CH_TRUST_WEBPKI
--- new
#ifdef CH_TRUST_WEBPKI
